{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/opalz-danube-al-barsha","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":663,"crm_id":"1149","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Opalz","slug":"opalz-danube-al-barsha","display_address":"Al Barsha","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2025","developer":"Danube Properties","price":600000,"display_price":"600K","lattitude":25.0693976,"longitude":55.2454044,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":"0","about":"<p>Opalz by Danube is two 23-storey towers offering residences with different sizes and layouts: from compact<strong> studios to 1-2 bedroom apartments</strong>. The distinctive features of the buildings are eco-friendly materials and high energy efficiency. All living spaces are finished according to a design project, and inside there is furniture, sanitary ware and kitchen sets.</p><p>Residents can enjoy a high level of service, SPA-center, swimming pool, playground for children, recreation areas. For the safety of residents will be responsible for round-the-clock security, concierge service will take care of household issues. If someone from the household falls ill, a doctor can be called at home, and an experienced nanny will come to the aid of adults, if it is necessary to leave someone with the children.</p><p>The residential complex is surrounded by developed infrastructure. Nearby are commercial organizations and social facilities. In the neighborhood there are many educational institutions. In a few minutes' walk there are bus stops. The routes run around the neighborhood and reach the Mall of the Emirates metro station.</p><p>The project is located next to New Science Park, close to Dubai Miracle Garden. The intersection of Umm Suqeim Street and Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road is 1.5 km away, providing motorists with shortcuts to popular areas of Dubai. The Burj Khalifa Tower is 19 km away and the International Airport is 37 km away.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1149/images/2024/02/25/YDVF11yvXKRGaNgcT0UDnCLgiuBbrxYzqlqcqfM7.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/25/YDVF11yvXKRGaNgcT0UDnCLgiuBbrxYzqlqcqfM7.png","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1149/images/2024/02/25/RSxTbwrLpLukcu555vagYkYwDA6uoF2gljnE7ly2.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/25/RSxTbwrLpLukcu555vagYkYwDA6uoF2gljnE7ly2.png","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1149/images/2024/02/25/ba14z2ic8Qxw11sA6bCNvoZpWgLzt36FpoSjzkBX.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/25/ba14z2ic8Qxw11sA6bCNvoZpWgLzt36FpoSjzkBX.png","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1149/images/2024/02/25/Dq4c0J6kKyncRwSODfYyIYSHG0OMlRCUGu4I20HB.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/25/Dq4c0J6kKyncRwSODfYyIYSHG0OMlRCUGu4I20HB.png","__ggfxIndex":3}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":1673,"url":"","file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/opalz_7627cc32e5.pdf","hash":"opalz_7627cc32e5","name":"Opalz by Danube Brochure"},"item":[],"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.png","hash":"General_Brochure_90d7160d65","name":"General"}},"video_module":{"id":933,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[],"payment_plan_text":"","payment_plans":[],"community":"","publish":1,"currency":"","amenities":[{"id":7597,"url":null,"text":"Covered Parking","type":null,"image":null},{"id":7598,"url":null,"text":"Security and CCTV","type":null,"image":null},{"id":7599,"url":null,"text":"Concierge Service","type":null,"image":null},{"id":7600,